<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-bs-theme="light">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Cache-control" content="no-cache">

  <title>Kombucha w/ side of IT</title>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="script-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net;">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="./media/icons/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="./media/icons/favicon-32x32.png" sizes="32x32">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="./media/icons/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
  integrity="sha384-aFq/bzH65dt+w6FI2ooMVUpc+21e0SRygnTpmBvdBgSdnuTN7QbdgL+OapgHtvPp" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <style>
    .flex-art-container{
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .gong {
      padding: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include("headermenu.ejs") %>

  <div class="alert alert-info" role="alert">
    EJS (Embedded Java Script): It's <%= time%> on <%= day %> <%= month %> <%= daynumber %>, <%= year %> <%= timezone %>
  </div>
  <button class="btn btn-light">Light</button>
  <button class="btn btn-dark">Dark</button>


  <div class="px-4 pt-5 my-5 text-center border-bottom">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-body-emphasis">Kombucha<br>with side of IT</h1>
    <div class="col-lg-6 mx-auto">
      <p class="lead mb-4">Welcome to this hybrid website, where we focus on making great bouch, providing IT services, practicing coding
        and including everyone with an interest. This site is a startup, but with our love of kombucha and learning we will be adding 
        projects, soliciting input, and having fun! Interactive functionality will be added eventutally.
      </p>
      <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-sm-flex justify-content-sm-center mb-5">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4 me-sm-3" disabled>Offerings (will open soon)</button>
        <a href="/voting" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4" role="button">Current Voters</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="overflow-hidden" style="max-height: 50vh;">
      <div class="container px-5">
        <img src="./media/bouch/guthealth.jpg" class="img-fluid border rounded-3 shadow-lg mb-4" alt="Example image" width="700"
          height="500" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container px-4 py-5" id="featured-3">
    <h2 class="pb-2 border-bottom">What in the H E Double hockeysticks is going on here?</h2>
    <div class="row g-4 py-5 row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-3">
      <div class="feature col">
        <div
          class="feature-icon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-bg-primary bg-gradient fs-2 mb-3">
          <img src="./briefcase.svg" alt="briefcase" height="30">
        </div>
        <h3 class="fs-2">Projects</h3>
        <p>The main goal of this site will be documenting work on real world projects that interest me and the team I am lucky enough to work with.
          These projects are not intended to be our main focus or to consume all of our waking hours. Instead they are a way to 
          have fun, plan, learn, pratice creativity, and explore new things as a team.
        </p>

        <a class="icon-link">          
          <button class="btn btn-primary">Current Projects</button>
        </a>

      </div>
      <div class="feature col">
        <div
          class="feature-icon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-bg-primary bg-gradient fs-2 mb-3">
          <img src="./bus-front.svg" alt="bus-front" height="30">
        </div>
        <h3 class="fs-2">Services of Tech Nature</h3>
        <br>
        <p> Secondary goals will be to pratice and perfect Full Stack Coding. I will also be offering limited professional services as time permits including:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li>Custom IT and Data Analysis Training</li>
          <li>Software Developement for Small Business and Non Profits</li>
          <li>IT Consultation and Advice</li>
        </ol>
        
        <a class="icon-link">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="services">Get Started Free</button>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="feature col">
        <div
          class="feature-icon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-bg-primary bg-gradient fs-2 mb-3">
          <img src="./chat-square-heart.svg" alt="chat-square-heart" height="30">
        </div>
        <h3 class="fs-2">Personal Touch</h3>
        <p>I am a real person. I work serveral IT jobs for local and state goverment, I teach at State University Undergraduate 
          level and support Graduate IT and Data courses. I love learning new things and passing on what I have learned to others.
          I enjoy helping others when I have the time and spending time with a few very special people that I love with all of my heart.
          People that know me will let you know I am easy going and I don't take life too serioiusly.</p>
        <a href="#" class="icon-link">
          Get a quote
          <img src="./chevron-right.svg" alt="chevron-right">
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex-art-container">
    <div><img class="gong" height=100 src="media/bouch/gongpic.png"></div>
    <div><h1>Kombucha Art Carousel</h1></div>
    <div><img class="gong" height=100 src="media/bouch/gongpic.png"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div id="carouselExampleIndicators" class="carousel slide">
      <div class="carousel-indicators">
        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators" data-bs-slide-to="0"
          aria-current="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators" data-bs-slide-to="1" class="active"
          aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators" data-bs-slide-to="2"
          aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
        <button type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators" data-bs-slide-to="3"
          aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-inner">
        <div class="carousel-item active">
          <img src="media/bouch/monk.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="couple">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
          <img src="media/bouch/fruitmonk.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="dog">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
          <img src="media/bouch/kombuchatree.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="dog">
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-item">
          <img src="media/bouch/mountainpensive.jpg" class="d-block w-100" alt="family">
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators"
        data-bs-slide="prev">
        <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
      </button>
      <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExampleIndicators"
        data-bs-slide="next">
        <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

<%- include("footermain.ejs") %>
 
<a href="/calendarscrap" class="btn btn-success" role="button">Developing New Calendar</a>


<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
integrity="sha384-ENjdO4Dr2bkBIFxQpeoTz1HIcje39Wm4jDKdf19U8gI4ddQ3GYNS7NTKfAdVQSZe"
crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<script src="./js/index.js"></script> 
</body>

</html>